{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>土瓜灣有人懷疑猝斃。今日（10日）上午10時27分，一名49歲姓伍男子在浙江街27號寶德大廈家中睡房暈倒，其家人見狀報警求助。</p><p>救護員趕至，經檢查後，證實伍男已當場不治。案件列「屍體發現」，警方將安排為伍男驗屍以確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名49歲男子在浙江街27號寶德大廈家中睡房暈倒，當場不治。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196847021273649152157062.png/UXeCv8eE88b0yHRE9Y4zCGWXiVTfPrdvHy_26B8v9ug\"/><figcaption>一名49歲男子在浙江街27號寶德大廈家中睡房暈倒，當場不治。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.062261+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:30:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:40.026420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:00.181688+00:00","content_hash":"265169b627fba17844987fb4cce22ba598d49015236d74eb139e437571002eb1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}